    "problem": "Significant discrepancies exist between climate model simulations and proxy-based reconstructions of the Mid-Miocene Climatic Optimum, complicating efforts to constrain past CO2 levels and climate sensitivity.",
    "method": "This study investigates the Mid-Miocene climate using a climate model with modified paleo-topography to simulate conditions under varied CO\u2082 levels, comparing the results with geological proxy data to evaluate the climate response.",
    "task": "The task is to simulate the climate of the Mid-Miocene Climatic Optimum under varying CO\u2082 levels, comparing the model against proxy data and to modern and future climate projections.",
